WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

2
00:03:16.612 --> 00:03:17.947
Wh-What is happening?

3
00:03:18.155 --> 00:03:20.157
--What a commotion!
--Who is ascending to heaven?

4
00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:21.909
Who is the lucky man?

5
00:03:22.118 --> 00:03:23.327
What a spectacle!

6
00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:27.581
--My... My temple!
--Normally it's just a tremor or two. But look at this!

7
00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.000
The sky has almost fallen upon us!

8
00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:33.212
He must be a man of extraordinary talent.
Certainly well-cultivated!

9
00:03:33.421 --> 00:03:35.256
Heaven helps the virtuous!
Fortune has smiled upon him!

10
00:03:35.464 --> 00:03:40.469
--Extraordinary! Amazing!
--It's just like when the prince of Xian Le ascended hundreds of years ago!

11
00:03:40.678 --> 00:03:44.765
--Don't even mention his name, it's bad luck!
--Let's go and see who it is!

12
00:03:45.349 --> 00:03:46.517
Let's go!

13
00:04:03.826 --> 00:04:06.203
Huh?! Not him again!

14
00:04:22.553 --> 00:04:24.764
Congratulations, Your Royal Highness!

15
00:04:24.972 --> 00:04:31.103
On winning first place and becoming
"Most likely to be cast out of heaven"!

16
00:04:32.521 --> 00:04:35.274
Although it's first place...
It's not much to be proud of!

17
00:04:35.483 --> 00:04:37.443
The winner is awarded 100 merit points.

18
00:04:37.651 --> 00:04:40.696
Great! Count me in
next time there's a contest.

19
00:04:40.905 --> 00:04:42.448
Do you know who came in second?

20
00:04:42.656 --> 00:04:46.494
It's hard to say--I'm so popular
that I should win the top three spots!

21
00:04:46.702 --> 00:04:49.622
That's right, no one came in second.

22
00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.041
You are head and shoulders above the rest.

23
00:04:52.249 --> 00:04:54.835
So, who won last time?

24
00:04:55.044 --> 00:05:01.509
No one: the ranking only
started this year. Today, actually.

25
00:05:01.717 --> 00:05:05.137
Oh, all right. I suppose I'm lucky.
I made it just in time.

26
00:05:06.889 --> 00:05:09.183
Do you realize why you won?

27
00:05:09.391 --> 00:05:10.100
Thanks to public support?

28
00:05:10.309 --> 00:05:12.770
Your Royal Highness,
take a look at the bell over there.

29
00:05:14.897 --> 00:05:15.773
Where?

30
00:05:15.981 --> 00:05:19.902
You're right, the bell is gone.

31
00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:23.739
While you were ascending, it collapsed
onto a heavenly official passing by.

32
00:05:25.407 --> 00:05:26.909
And what now?

33
00:05:27.117 --> 00:05:28.619
It's still being repaired.

34
00:05:28.828 --> 00:05:29.912
I mean, the heavenly official.

35
00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.580
Being a martial god,

36
00:05:31.789 --> 00:05:33.749
he sliced right through the bell
with a flick of the wrist.

37
00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:34.792
Uh...

38
00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.545
Take a look at that golden palace.

39
00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:41.966
--Ah, this time I see it!
--You're not supposed to see it.

40
00:05:42.174 --> 00:05:43.300
There's actually nothing there.

41
00:05:43.509 --> 00:05:46.762
Several palaces collapsed
in the earthquake when you ascended.

42
00:05:46.971 --> 00:05:50.182
There was no time for repairs--
we've set up some temporary palaces.

43
00:05:50.391 --> 00:05:51.851
This means it's my fault?

44
00:05:52.059 --> 00:05:54.770
Yes, it does.

45
00:05:54.979 --> 00:05:57.690
Have I offended many officials
right after ascending?

46
00:05:57.898 --> 00:05:59.316
Nothing that can't be fixed.

47
00:05:59.525 --> 00:06:00.442
How can I fix it?

48
00:06:00.651 --> 00:06:04.321
That's easy--it will just take
8.88 million merit points.

49
00:06:05.531 --> 00:06:07.908
I know, you don't
even have a tenth of that.

50
00:06:08.117 --> 00:06:10.536
Or even a thousandth, to be honest.

51
00:06:11.954 --> 00:06:14.957
Don't worry.
If there is a will, there is a way.

52
00:06:15.165 --> 00:06:17.877
The way for me
never seems to lead anywhere.

53
00:06:18.085 --> 00:06:21.755
I have an idea. Do you still remember
the password for the Telepathy Matrix?

54
00:06:21.964 --> 00:06:23.465
Hmmm...

55
00:06:32.933 --> 00:06:36.103
Hello. Has everyone arrived?

56
00:06:36.312 --> 00:06:39.607
The emperor had to tend to a
matter in the north. He needs men.

57
00:06:39.815 --> 00:06:43.903
Could any of you
dispatch two military officials?

58
00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:48.616
Rumor has it the emperor
is not in the north.

59
00:06:48.824 --> 00:06:51.493
Perhaps you are recruiting
on someone else's behalf?

60
00:06:51.702 --> 00:06:55.956
Your Highness, there is a way
to earn merit points quickly.

61
00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.337
There have recently been countless
worshippers in the north

62
00:07:01.545 --> 00:07:05.633
pleading for heavenly officials to come
and vanquish the evil ghosts.

63
00:07:05.841 --> 00:07:11.305
The emperor has no time for the north.
General Ming Guang is also busy.

64
00:07:11.513 --> 00:07:14.016
If Your Highness goes in his stead,

65
00:07:14.224 --> 00:07:19.313
you'll be offered countless merit points.

66
00:07:19.772 --> 00:07:21.857
Huh? isn't this His Highness
the Crown Prince?

67
00:07:22.066 --> 00:07:24.610
--Why did he ascend again...?
--Come on, it's the third time already.

68
00:07:24.818 --> 00:07:26.487
Is Your Highness back?

69
00:07:26.695 --> 00:07:29.782
--I bet he won't last a year!
--A year, no way!

70
00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:32.076
I bet three days.

71
00:07:37.164 --> 00:07:41.543
Was Ling Wen just trying to recruit
on behalf of the Crown Prince?

72
00:07:41.752 --> 00:07:44.964
Of course! Xie Lian
needs people more than anyone!

73
00:07:45.172 --> 00:07:48.801
--No incense, no palace, no believers...
--Hah, he's empty-handed, the laughingstock of the Three Realms!

74
00:07:50.594 --> 00:07:53.138
I told you no one
would be willing to help.

75
00:07:55.224 --> 00:07:57.142
Hello everyone, here I am again.

76
00:07:57.351 --> 00:08:01.021
What a scene Your Highness
caused when you ascended!

77
00:08:01.981 --> 00:08:02.940
It wasn't so bad.

78
00:08:03.148 --> 00:08:05.901
Maybe not for you, but it was for me.

79
00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:08.278
Your Highness, the bell.

80
00:08:10.155 --> 00:08:13.450
I've heard about the bell.
I am terribly sorry that it struck you.

81
00:08:13.659 --> 00:08:14.451
Hm!

82
00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:17.413
Sir... what shall I call you?

83
00:08:19.581 --> 00:08:21.959
--Wow, he's forgotten!
--Must be memory loss!

84
00:08:22.167 --> 00:08:24.003
Your Highness, this is Xuan Zhen.

85
00:08:24.211 --> 00:08:27.297
Xuan Zhen? I thought it was Mu Qing!

86
00:08:28.924 --> 00:08:31.218
Who has torn down my palace?

87
00:08:33.053 --> 00:08:34.596
Show your face!

88
00:08:35.639 --> 00:08:38.017
It was you? Fine. I'll show you.

89
00:08:38.225 --> 00:08:41.645
The guilty party is right here.
Ask him yourself.

90
00:08:45.357 --> 00:08:47.901
It was me, I'm very sorry.

91
00:08:48.861 --> 00:08:50.612
Your Highness, that's Nan Yang.

92
00:08:50.821 --> 00:08:54.199
I know, but I think
he didn't recognize me.

93
00:08:54.408 --> 00:08:56.618
No, he just spends most of
his time in the mortal realms

94
00:08:56.827 --> 00:08:58.495
and didn't know you had ascended.

95
00:08:58.704 --> 00:09:00.497
I wanted to apologize to all of you.

96
00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:04.752
I will compensate you for your losses.
Just give me some time.

97
00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:09.048
Hm! I hope Your Highness
will keep your word.

98
00:09:09.256 --> 00:09:13.302
I still have business to attend to.
Please excuse me.

99
00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:17.097
--I still have things to do.
--Goodbye. --Goodbye.

100
00:09:22.978 --> 00:09:24.021
I'm so sorry.

101
00:09:24.229 --> 00:09:28.025
If Xuan Zhen hadn't spoken up,
we would have recruited someone.

102
00:09:28.233 --> 00:09:30.235
Don't worry, I'm used to being on my own.

103
00:09:30.444 --> 00:09:32.071
Do you need a magic weapon?

104
00:09:32.279 --> 00:09:35.532
Thanks, I'm fine. I didn't have much
magic after being banished twice,

105
00:09:35.741 --> 00:09:37.785
and I couldn't use magical weapons
in the mortal realms anyway.

106
00:09:37.993 --> 00:09:40.329
Very well.
This task is of the utmost importance.

107
00:09:40.537 --> 00:09:46.919
Your Highness, please be careful.
Let me know if you run into any trouble.

108
00:09:47.127 --> 00:09:49.963
I will try to help if I can.

109
00:09:50.881 --> 00:09:56.678
This has the details of your task.
Do you have any questions?

110
00:09:57.638 --> 00:09:59.848
Ling Wen, I really have to thank you.

111
00:10:01.892 --> 00:10:08.357
I'm just doing my job. You can
thank the Emperor when he's back.

112
00:10:08.565 --> 00:10:09.650
All right.

113
00:10:15.823 --> 00:10:22.621
Your Highness, I wish you luck.
May the blessings of heaven be with you.

114
00:10:25.624 --> 00:10:27.417
I fear nothing.

115
00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:33.298
"Mt. Yujun"

116
00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:43.475
Have you heard?
Something is up on Mt. Yujun again.

117
00:10:43.684 --> 00:10:44.935
Really? Someone went missing again?

118
00:10:45.144 --> 00:10:46.019
That's right...

119
00:10:46.228 --> 00:10:49.606
When will this end?
Another girl has gone missing.

120
00:10:49.606 --> 00:10:51.692
"The Meeting Shop" When will this
end? Another girl has gone missing.

121
00:10:51.692 --> 00:10:55.487
"The Meeting Shop"

122
00:10:59.992 --> 00:11:03.829
Come in, take a seat.

123
00:11:10.002 --> 00:11:12.921
--Could I please have a pot of tea?
--Got it.

124
00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:16.258
Just wondering, has there recently
been anything out of the ordinary?

125
00:11:16.466 --> 00:11:19.678
Well, I just mind my own business...

126
00:11:37.654 --> 00:11:41.533
Your Highness! Your Highness!

127
00:11:41.742 --> 00:11:44.578
--Ling Wen?
--Good news!

128
00:11:44.786 --> 00:11:48.665
Two junior officials from
heaven are coming to help.

129
00:11:48.874 --> 00:11:50.792
They should be there by now.

130
00:11:51.001 --> 00:11:53.086
Junior officials?

131
00:11:57.591 --> 00:12:00.219
Ling Wen, they don't look
like they're here to help.

132
00:12:00.427 --> 00:12:04.264
They look more like executioners.
Did you trick them into coming?

133
00:12:04.473 --> 00:12:06.600
Ling Wen? Ling Wen?

134
00:12:18.987 --> 00:12:20.822
Just wondering--you are...?

135
00:12:21.031 --> 00:12:22.074
Nan Feng.

136
00:12:22.282 --> 00:12:24.409
--Fu Yao.
--I didn't mean your names.

137
00:12:24.618 --> 00:12:26.370
I appreciate you coming to help me.

138
00:12:26.578 --> 00:12:28.789
Could you tell me who you're working for?

139
00:12:28.997 --> 00:12:29.706
General Nan Yang.

140
00:12:29.915 --> 00:12:31.250
General Xuan Zhen.

141
00:12:33.418 --> 00:12:37.547
Y-You mean... the two generals sent you?

142
00:12:37.756 --> 00:12:39.633
My general doesn't know about this.

143
00:12:39.841 --> 00:12:41.343
Mine doesn't, either.

144
00:12:43.762 --> 00:12:46.473
Do you know who I am then?

145
00:12:46.682 --> 00:12:48.684
You are the Crown Prince!

146
00:12:48.892 --> 00:12:52.312
You are the true path,
the center of heaven and earth!

147
00:12:52.521 --> 00:12:54.481
Did he just roll his eyes?

148
00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:56.233
Yeah, just kick him out.

149
00:12:56.441 --> 00:12:58.819
Hey, you're the one
who should be kicked out!

150
00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:05.659
Wait, wait! Did you really
come here of your own accord?

151
00:13:05.867 --> 00:13:07.411
There's no need to force things!

152
00:13:08.453 --> 00:13:10.289
I-wanted-to-come-here!

153
00:13:13.125 --> 00:13:17.462
Let's cut to the chase.
There is a legend about Mt. Yujun.

154
00:13:17.671 --> 00:13:20.590
Legend has it, there is a ghost
bridegroom living in the mountains.

155
00:13:20.799 --> 00:13:23.844
He is hideous and stealthy
and preys on brides.

156
00:13:23.844 --> 00:13:24.428
He is hideous and stealthy
and preys on brides.

157
00:13:24.636 --> 00:13:27.723
Seventeen brides have gone
missing over the past century.

158
00:13:27.931 --> 00:13:30.976
And over 100 people in
bridal processions have been killed.

159
00:13:31.184 --> 00:13:32.978
News of this hadn't reached heaven.

160
00:13:33.186 --> 00:13:36.940
Then, the 17th bride's father
turned out to be a senior official.

161
00:13:37.149 --> 00:13:38.775
When he heard of the legend,
he picked 40 valiant attendants,

162
00:13:38.984 --> 00:13:45.490
who were to guard the bridal procession,
yet his daughter still disappeared.

163
00:13:45.699 --> 00:13:50.013
The official loved his daughter dearly,
and, enraged, he and his powerful friends

164
00:13:50.245 --> 00:13:51.580
prayed and made offerings
with all their energy.

165
00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:52.122
prayed and made offerings
with all their energy.

166
00:13:52.331 --> 00:13:53.832
They put a big bounty on the Ghost Groom,

167
00:13:54.041 --> 00:13:56.126
and the people in the
entire north became worried.

168
00:13:56.335 --> 00:13:58.920
This is when the heavenly officials
learned about the matter.

169
00:13:59.129 --> 00:14:02.716
Our goal is to capture the Ghost Groom.

170
00:14:02.924 --> 00:14:05.802
Do the missing brides
share anything in common?

171
00:14:06.011 --> 00:14:08.221
There are poor ones, rich ones,
pretty ones and plain ones.

172
00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:13.143
Some were to be wives, others concubines.
In short, they're all different.

173
00:14:13.352 --> 00:14:15.145
Has anyone seen this Ghost Groom?

174
00:14:15.354 --> 00:14:16.730
No.

175
00:14:17.939 --> 00:14:21.651
Since no one has seen him,
how do we know it's the Ghost Groom?

176
00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:25.739
That's just what we call him.
But you have a point.

177
00:14:25.947 --> 00:14:29.868
The sun is about to set.
Let's get settled in, and then we'll talk.

178
00:14:35.874 --> 00:14:37.376
What's going on?

179
00:14:41.463 --> 00:14:44.549
These people have no fear!
Perfect time to send off a bride!

180
00:14:57.437 --> 00:14:58.939
Something is off about these people.

181
00:14:59.147 --> 00:15:02.067
--Let's check it out.
--Stop! Stop!

182
00:15:02.275 --> 00:15:03.902
Who's this?

183
00:15:05.278 --> 00:15:06.530
Get out of our way!

184
00:15:07.447 --> 00:15:09.866
Miss, they just want to use you
as bait for the Ghost Groom.

185
00:15:10.075 --> 00:15:11.201
Don't fall for it!

186
00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:13.161
Out of our way!

187
00:15:17.833 --> 00:15:19.251
It looks fake!

188
00:15:19.459 --> 00:15:22.421
Hmph, it's you again!

189
00:15:22.629 --> 00:15:25.590
You witch, always getting in my way!

190
00:15:26.675 --> 00:15:31.638
If you had agreed to dress up as a bride,
I could have spared this piece of wood!

191
00:15:31.847 --> 00:15:33.140
What a hideous girl.

192
00:15:33.348 --> 00:15:34.850
Fu Yao, it's not nice
to say things like that.

193
00:15:35.058 --> 00:15:37.602
Isn't that Pengtou and Miss Ying?

194
00:15:37.811 --> 00:15:38.478
It's them!

195
00:15:38.687 --> 00:15:43.108
Oh, this Pengtou, always leading his gang
into all kinds of shady business.

196
00:15:43.316 --> 00:15:46.987
He's set his sights on the bounty and
decided to hunt down the Ghost Groom.

197
00:15:47.195 --> 00:15:51.533
Don't listen to them.
Mt. Yujun is too dangerous; don't go!

198
00:15:51.741 --> 00:15:52.993
All he cares about is the bounty.

199
00:15:53.201 --> 00:15:54.369
What's wrong with making some cash?

200
00:15:54.578 --> 00:15:57.706
We'd also rid everyone of this scoundrel.

201
00:15:57.914 --> 00:15:59.875
That's right!
And it's not even that much money!

202
00:16:00.083 --> 00:16:02.085
But this is suicide!

203
00:16:02.294 --> 00:16:04.254
I had asked you to dress up
as a bride, and you refused.

204
00:16:04.463 --> 00:16:06.965
And now you're blocking our way
once we've set out to get him!

205
00:16:07.174 --> 00:16:08.216
What do you want?

206
00:16:08.425 --> 00:16:09.509
Yeah, tell us, what do you want?

207
00:16:09.718 --> 00:16:12.929
You are so set on not letting us go--
could you have fallen for the Ghost Groom?

208
00:16:13.138 --> 00:16:14.514
Nonsense!

209
00:16:14.723 --> 00:16:18.226
Every few days, you run off to
Mt. Yujun. Everyone has seen it!

210
00:16:18.435 --> 00:16:19.686
That's right!

211
00:16:19.895 --> 00:16:21.563
Now tell me, where's your boyfriend?

212
00:16:21.771 --> 00:16:25.275
I don't know... Stay away from me!

213
00:16:33.617 --> 00:16:35.285
What a bully!

214
00:16:37.078 --> 00:16:39.873
I've heard the Ghost Groom's face
is completely covered in bandages.

215
00:16:40.081 --> 00:16:41.875
You two would make a perfect couple!

216
00:16:49.466 --> 00:16:51.801
Who... Who the hell are you?

217
00:16:55.472 --> 00:16:57.807
He has evil powers! Get him!

218
00:17:14.533 --> 00:17:17.202
So, are we done here?

219
00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:21.248
Fine, I'll let you win today.
But watch your back, I'll show you!

220
00:17:28.338 --> 00:17:29.839
Don't forget to compensate
them for the post!

221
00:17:30.048 --> 00:17:31.132
Got it.

222
00:17:33.051 --> 00:17:35.512
Are you hurt?

223
00:17:37.931 --> 00:17:41.309
What... What are you doing?

224
00:17:43.603 --> 00:17:46.565
--Miss, your...
--Ah! You pervert!

225
00:17:49.359 --> 00:17:50.777
Your dress is torn...

226
00:17:50.777 --> 00:17:51.361
Your dress is torn...

227
00:17:54.781 --> 00:17:56.825
This is why we should
mind our own business!

228
00:17:57.033 --> 00:17:58.660
You helped her,
and in return you got a beating.

229
00:17:58.868 --> 00:18:00.036
This is so typical of you.

230
00:18:00.245 --> 00:18:03.290
All right, the bill is taken care of;
you're free to go!

231
00:18:04.833 --> 00:18:05.875
Thank you.

232
00:18:06.084 --> 00:18:09.170
Right, do you know how to get
to the nearest Ming Guang temple?

233
00:18:09.379 --> 00:18:12.882
Ming Guang temple?
I don't think there are any here.

234
00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:16.344
You don't have any?
How is it possible...?

235
00:18:16.553 --> 00:18:21.558
Well, we do have a Nan Yang temple.
It's just five miles from here.

236
00:18:21.766 --> 00:18:24.394
Make a right turn out of the
city gate, and it'll be right there.

237
00:18:35.530 --> 00:18:38.450
Strange, the north is clearly under
General Ming Guang's control,

238
00:18:38.658 --> 00:18:40.952
but there's only a temple
of General Nan Yang.

239
00:18:44.039 --> 00:18:45.498
Though Nan Yang controls the southeast,

240
00:18:45.707 --> 00:18:48.376
there is quite a bit of incense
lit in his honor in the north.

241
00:18:49.711 --> 00:18:52.213
You're right, he seems quite popular.

242
00:18:52.422 --> 00:18:54.549
But I have a question,
I just don't know...

243
00:18:54.758 --> 00:18:57.177
if you should ask it or not?
Then just don't ask.

244
00:18:58.678 --> 00:19:01.181
Actually, I was about to say,
I don't know who can answer it.

245
00:19:01.389 --> 00:19:04.351
Is it about the story
behind Nan Yang temple?

246
00:19:04.559 --> 00:19:07.145
--The story?
--You, be quiet!

247
00:19:07.354 --> 00:19:11.691
Long ago, Nan Yang was
known as Ju Yang, or "Big Yang."

248
00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:17.089
And then a careless king made a mistake
and turned the second part into "Wang."

249
00:19:17.113 --> 00:19:21.076
All of the Big Yang temples change
their names to "Big Wang temples."

250
00:19:21.284 --> 00:19:21.618
Word traveled fast...

251
00:19:21.618 --> 00:19:23.078
Word traveled fast...

252
00:19:23.078 --> 00:19:23.953
Word traveled fast...

253
00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.164
The mistake has been corrected.

254
00:19:26.373 --> 00:19:27.457
And what good did that do?

255
00:19:27.666 --> 00:19:31.711
To this day, most of the
visitors to his temple are women,

256
00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:34.589
blushing as they make their wishes.

257
00:19:34.798 --> 00:19:39.386
That's enough!
Go sweep the floor if you're bored!

258
00:19:39.594 --> 00:19:40.470
What did you say?

259
00:19:40.679 --> 00:19:42.681
Hah, don't you remember

260
00:19:42.889 --> 00:19:45.809
how your general served His Highness tea,
swept the floor, and made his bed?

261
00:19:46.017 --> 00:19:47.435
If I didn't know you better,

262
00:19:47.644 --> 00:19:50.814
I would think you're
standing up for His Highness.

263
00:19:51.022 --> 00:19:52.982
It's true that your general is ungrateful.

264
00:19:53.191 --> 00:19:56.361
His Highness brought him to heaven
when he ascended that time,

265
00:19:56.569 --> 00:19:59.823
but your general turned his back
on him and banned all talk of it.

266
00:20:00.031 --> 00:20:02.242
Your general is no better.

267
00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:04.411
As His Highness' bodyguard,
he was supposed to be loyal.

268
00:20:04.619 --> 00:20:07.497
Instead, he betrayed his master.

269
00:20:07.706 --> 00:20:09.582
You two...

270
00:20:22.804 --> 00:20:24.347
Don't eat it!

271
00:20:25.515 --> 00:20:27.142
It's dirty!

272
00:20:27.767 --> 00:20:29.144
Stop!

273
00:20:31.271 --> 00:20:35.233
First, I am the Crown Prince
you were talking about.

274
00:20:35.442 --> 00:20:39.195
I won't say a word,
so don't use me against each other.

275
00:20:39.404 --> 00:20:44.492
Also, you're here to help me.
Shouldn't I be calling the shots?

276
00:20:44.701 --> 00:20:46.411
--Yes...
--Yes...

277
00:20:46.619 --> 00:20:49.539
All right, let's get down to business.

278
00:20:49.748 --> 00:20:52.584
Can one of you let me use your magic
so I can contact Ling Wen?

279
00:20:53.418 --> 00:20:55.211
What happened to your own magic?

280
00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:56.755
I don't have enough.

281
00:21:06.264 --> 00:21:09.851
Your Highness, is everything
going smoothly in the north?

282
00:21:10.059 --> 00:21:12.729
Are the two junior officials helping you?

283
00:21:12.937 --> 00:21:16.191
They are. They each have their strengths.
And definitely potential.

284
00:21:16.399 --> 00:21:19.444
Great. The north is
under General Pei's control.

285
00:21:19.652 --> 00:21:20.779
There's always incense burning for him.

286
00:21:20.987 --> 00:21:24.324
If you need to, you can
stay at a Ming Guang temple.

287
00:21:24.532 --> 00:21:27.994
We couldn't find a Ming Guang temple,
so we set up camp at a Nan Yang temple.

288
00:21:28.203 --> 00:21:30.705
You couldn't find one? How strange...

289
00:21:30.914 --> 00:21:34.334
Do you have any more information
about the Ghost Groom?

290
00:21:34.542 --> 00:21:38.171
Yes, we have his rating.
He belongs to the Wrath level of demons.

291
00:21:38.379 --> 00:21:42.967
Second on the Devastation,
Wrath, Terror, and Wickedness scale,

292
00:21:43.176 --> 00:21:44.844
only the Devastation level
is more ferocious.

293
00:21:45.053 --> 00:21:49.933
If we don't act, there will be
terrible devastation and loss of life.

294
00:21:51.309 --> 00:21:55.146
Your Highness, please take
care of it as soon as you can.

295
00:21:56.940 --> 00:22:00.860
Why did the rating take so long?
Ling Wen could be a bit more efficient!

296
00:22:01.069 --> 00:22:04.489
The Ghost Groom is a Wrath-level demon.
Don't underestimate him.

297
00:22:04.697 --> 00:22:08.117
We need to do something ASAP.
You two have any ideas?

298
00:22:08.952 --> 00:22:13.164
Since the Ghost Groom is after brides,
that's what we should use to bait him.

299
00:22:13.373 --> 00:22:15.583
But mannequins and deceit
won't work on a Wrath demon.

300
00:22:15.792 --> 00:22:17.168
We need to use a real person.

301
00:22:17.377 --> 00:22:21.047
Not every bride ends up being abducted.
There must be something else, too.

302
00:22:21.256 --> 00:22:25.552
Anyway, we should use a girl as bait
and see what happens.

303
00:22:25.760 --> 00:22:29.597
No, no, if we fail,
we will be sending her to her grave.

304
00:22:29.806 --> 00:22:32.475
Very well... so do you suggest
using a man instead?

305
00:22:32.684 --> 00:22:35.144
What kind of man would be
willing to dress up as...?

306
00:22:39.315 --> 00:22:40.358
Huh?

307
00:22:59.794 --> 00:23:02.839
If I were the Ghost Groom and
someone sent me a bride like her...

308
00:23:03.047 --> 00:23:06.134
--You would wipe her village off the face of the earth?
--I think I'd kill her.

309
00:23:06.342 --> 00:23:08.761
Good thing I'm not her!

310
00:23:08.970 --> 00:23:11.306
Your Lordship!

311
00:23:12.807 --> 00:23:16.686
You're... the girl from yesterday...

312
00:23:16.895 --> 00:23:20.607
Don't get me wrong,
this isn't my hobby or anything.

313
00:23:20.815 --> 00:23:23.985
We just want to lure out the Ghost Groom!

314
00:23:25.069 --> 00:23:28.156
Your Lordship, I'm sorry about yesterday,
about our misunderstanding!

315
00:23:28.364 --> 00:23:30.199
I heard the teashop owner say
that you were staying here,

316
00:23:30.408 --> 00:23:33.077
and I brought you some food
to thank you for helping me...

317
00:23:33.286 --> 00:23:36.497
It's fine, no need to worry about it!

318
00:23:36.706 --> 00:23:40.335
Your Lordship, I know how to
alter clothes and do make-up.

319
00:23:40.543 --> 00:23:43.463
Why don't I help dress you up as a bride?

320
00:23:43.671 --> 00:23:45.048
Oh...

321
00:23:56.184 --> 00:23:56.809
How are things going?

322
00:23:57.018 --> 00:23:58.519
We've hired some sedan bearers.

323
00:23:58.728 --> 00:24:01.898
They're locals--quite good at kung fu
and know their way around.

324
00:24:02.106 --> 00:24:03.733
They should be able to defend themselves.

325
00:24:03.942 --> 00:24:06.611
Your Highness, you should be careful.

326
00:24:08.321 --> 00:24:10.031
They did end up coming for the bounty!

327
00:24:10.239 --> 00:24:11.366
Ying, that little brat,

328
00:24:11.574 --> 00:24:14.118
wouldn't help her own people,
but she'll gladly help strangers.

329
00:24:14.327 --> 00:24:15.370
Isn't that right, Pengtou?

330
00:24:15.578 --> 00:24:18.581
Hmph! When a mantis devours a cicada,
the sparrow is never far behind.

331
00:24:18.790 --> 00:24:20.792
Let's see who will win this time.

332
00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:22.961
--Let's go! Hurry.
--Let's go!

333
00:24:30.510 --> 00:24:34.055
How does it feel to finally
get married at your ripe old age?

334
00:24:34.263 --> 00:24:38.184
It's too bad--I think something important
is missing from the wedding procession.

335
00:24:38.393 --> 00:24:40.812
I think everything's ready; what is it?

336
00:24:42.647 --> 00:24:44.273
Two maids for the bride.

337
00:24:45.191 --> 00:24:48.111
Your family is poor;
they can't afford maids!

338
00:24:49.112 --> 00:24:50.196
Fine.

339
00:24:50.405 --> 00:24:52.281
Where are we?

340
00:24:52.490 --> 00:24:54.450
We've been moving along
on Mt. Yujun for a while.

341
00:25:00.581 --> 00:25:01.833
What's wrong?

342
00:25:04.377 --> 00:25:06.129
Did you hear the giggling?!

343
00:25:07.422 --> 00:25:09.215
I didn't hear anything.

344
00:25:09.424 --> 00:25:10.675
Me neither.

345
00:25:12.927 --> 00:25:15.072
Am I supposed to be the
only one who can hear it?

346
00:25:16.889 --> 00:25:18.850
Something's off...

347
00:25:19.058 --> 00:25:21.352
Don't stop. Just ignore it.

348
00:25:25.648 --> 00:25:26.816
Someone's singing.

349
00:25:27.025 --> 00:25:28.443
What are they singing about?

350
00:25:28.693 --> 00:25:31.195
Weeping as she goes over the mountain,

351
00:25:31.404 --> 00:25:33.281
she veils her head,
never to smile again...

352
00:25:33.531 --> 00:25:36.242
What does that mean?
Are they warning you not to smile?

353
00:25:36.451 --> 00:25:40.621
It could be a setup.
Maybe you're not supposed to cry, either.

354
00:25:40.830 --> 00:25:44.667
Whether I laugh or cry,
what's the worst thing that could happen?

355
00:25:44.876 --> 00:25:46.419
You getting abducted.

356
00:25:46.627 --> 00:25:50.048
Right. I have something I need to tell you.

357
00:25:50.256 --> 00:25:52.091
What?

358
00:25:52.300 --> 00:25:55.762
Ever since I've gotten into
the sedan, I've been smiling.

359
00:26:07.231 --> 00:26:08.316
A wolf? There are wolves!

360
00:26:08.524 --> 00:26:10.151
How could there be wolves on Mt. Yujun?

361
00:26:24.373 --> 00:26:27.210
Looks like a magical formation.
We need to find its core.

362
00:26:27.585 --> 00:26:29.462
Nan Feng, Fu Yao,
will you be able to hang in there?

363
00:26:29.670 --> 00:26:31.881
Just a pack of animals--a piece of cake!

364
00:26:40.973 --> 00:26:42.475
G-Ghost!

365
00:26:42.725 --> 00:26:44.435
What happened?

366
00:26:44.644 --> 00:26:46.020
Don't come out!

367
00:26:50.858 --> 00:26:51.859
They're slave-goblins!

368
00:26:52.068 --> 00:26:55.363
I <i>hate</i> these things!
They just keep coming!

369
00:26:55.571 --> 00:26:58.116
If they wear us out, we're done for!

370
00:27:02.120 --> 00:27:04.038
Did Ling Wen say anything about them?

371
00:27:07.166 --> 00:27:08.501
Nope, nothing.

372
00:27:09.919 --> 00:27:11.212
How many total?

373
00:27:15.007 --> 00:27:17.176
More than 100! A lot!

374
00:27:17.552 --> 00:27:19.011
Ten is already a handful.

375
00:27:19.220 --> 00:27:20.680
If there are over 100,

376
00:27:20.888 --> 00:27:23.099
then we really have a problem!

377
00:27:26.894 --> 00:27:28.396
Go! Kill them!

378
00:27:43.703 --> 00:27:46.873
How are you able to use your magical
weapon if you're out of magic?

379
00:27:47.081 --> 00:27:48.541
I guess there are exceptions.

380
00:27:49.792 --> 00:27:50.418
You two should go ahead.

381
00:27:50.626 --> 00:27:51.294
What?

382
00:27:51.502 --> 00:27:53.880
When you stand around the sedan,
the beasts just keep coming.

383
00:27:54.088 --> 00:27:56.591
There's no way you can kill them all.
Just retreat now.

384
00:27:56.799 --> 00:27:57.425
What about you?

385
00:27:57.633 --> 00:28:00.261
I'll stay behind and see
who this Ghost Groom really is!

386
00:28:00.469 --> 00:28:04.348
Just throw them off
and come back later to help!

387
00:28:06.684 --> 00:28:08.519
Over here. Let's go!

388
00:29:12.500 --> 00:29:13.960
Who's there?

389
00:29:29.809 --> 00:29:32.061
In the central plains, there once
was a kingdom called Xian Le.

390
00:29:32.270 --> 00:29:35.606
Xie Lian was its Crown Prince.

391
00:29:35.815 --> 00:29:38.776
He cared deeply about his people,

392
00:29:38.985 --> 00:29:42.589
and was known far and wide for his virtue.

393
00:29:44.573 --> 00:29:46.885
One day on Shenwu Street...

394
00:29:59.672 --> 00:30:02.550
...he rescued a boy falling to his
death before a crowd of onlookers.

395
00:30:14.603 --> 00:30:19.400
His quick thinking on Yinian Bridge
rid his people of a ferocious demon.

396
00:31:03.235 --> 00:31:07.448
The emperor thought the
Crown Prince had unlimited potential.

397
00:31:07.656 --> 00:31:11.452
He ascended to heaven at a young age.

398
00:31:40.940 --> 00:31:44.294
Soon after, disaster struck in Xian Le.

399
00:31:44.318 --> 00:31:47.154
The Crown Prince decided to descend
to the mortal realm to rescue his kingdom,

400
00:31:47.363 --> 00:31:49.257
but his efforts were fruitless.

401
00:31:49.281 --> 00:31:51.242
What's the point,
even if they have a good relationship?

402
00:31:51.450 --> 00:31:53.470
--It has no future!
--Later, Xie Lian ascended and was thrown back out.

403
00:31:53.494 --> 00:31:59.208
--He's the first one to be thrown out just as he's becoming more active.
--Shame of the heavenly officials, laughingstock of the Three Realms.

404
00:32:43.252 --> 00:32:45.379
If you see no reason to live,

405
00:32:45.588 --> 00:32:48.674
then at least live for me.

405
00:32:49.305 --> 00:33:49.633
